  "problem": "If $A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$B=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}],$\nthen\n\n| $AB=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  | $\\,.$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |",
